@startuml seq_3_dilemma_vote
title Flow 3 – Post Dilemma → Vote → Comment → Notifications

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #1A237E
    ActorBorderColor #1565C0
    ActorBackgroundColor #E3F2FD
    ParticipantBorderColor #4527A0
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #EDE7F6
    DatabaseBorderColor #2E7D32
    DatabaseBackgroundColor #E8F5E9
    LifeLineBorderColor #AAAAAA
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8F9FC
    NoteBackgroundColor #FFF9C4
    NoteBorderColor #F9A825
}
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8

actor       "User A (Poster)"        as poster
actor       "User B (Voter)"         as voter
participant "Blazor Server"          as blazor
participant "NotificationService"    as notif  #EDE7F6
database    "PostgreSQL"             as pg

== Poster creates a dilemma ==

poster  ->  blazor  : Submit new dilemma\n(title, options, category, expiry)
blazor  ->  pg      : INSERT Dilemma + DilemmaOptions
pg      --> blazor  : Saved with new Guid
blazor  ->  notif   : NotifyNewPostAsync(dilemma, posterUserId)
notif   ->  pg      : SELECT CategorySubscriptions\nWHERE category = ? AND userId != poster
pg      --> notif   : Return subscriber list
notif   ->  pg      : INSERT Notification per subscriber\n(Type = NewPost)
blazor  --> poster  : Redirect to /dilemma/{id}

== Voter views & votes on the dilemma ==

voter   ->  blazor  : Navigate to /dilemma/{id}
blazor  ->  pg      : SELECT Dilemma + Options + Votes\n+ Comments (with Users)
pg      --> blazor  : Return full dilemma graph
blazor  --> voter   : Render dilemma page

voter   ->  blazor  : CastVote(selectedOption)
blazor  ->  pg      : INSERT Vote (userId, dilemmaOptionId)
blazor  ->  notif   : NotifyVoteAsync(voterName, dilemma)
notif   ->  pg      : UPSERT Notification for poster\n(Type = Vote – merges multiple voters)
blazor  ->  pg      : Reload dilemma (fresh vote counts)
blazor  --> voter   : Update vote bars in UI

== Voter posts a comment ==

voter   ->  blazor  : PostComment(body)
blazor  ->  pg      : INSERT Comment\n(userId, dilemmaId, body, createdAt)
blazor  ->  notif   : NotifyCommentAsync(voterName, dilemma, userId)
notif   ->  pg      : INSERT Notification for poster\n(Type = Comment)
blazor  --> voter   : Refresh comments section

== Poster views notifications ==

poster  ->  blazor  : Open /notification
blazor  ->  pg      : SELECT Notifications\nWHERE recipientUserId = poster\nORDER BY createdAt DESC
pg      --> blazor  : Vote + Comment notifications
blazor  --> poster  : Show notification feed\n(vote notification, comment notification)

@enduml
